{
  "dom_id": "step-17330",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Problem Solving Using the Ratio of a Fraction and an Integer",
  "problem": "At a certain sports center, there are $5$ equal-size pools. If a pump can empty $\\dfrac{3}{2}$ of a pool in $15$ minutes, then how many minutes will it take the pump to empty all $5$ pools?",
  "worked_solution": "To find the number of minutes that the pump takes to empty $5$ pools, we can first find the unit rate of minutes per pool, and then multiply the unit rate by $5$ pools.\n\nTo find the unit rate of minutes per pool, we divide the number of minutes, $15,$ by the total pool volume emptied, $\\dfrac{3}{2},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n15 \\div \\dfrac{3}{2}\n$$\n\nTo divide by a fraction, we multiply by the fraction's reciprocal:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}15÷\\frac{3}{2} & =15\\times \\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{1}\\times \\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{15\\times 2}{1\\times 3} \\\\  & =\\frac{30}{3} \\\\  & =30÷3 \\\\  & =10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the unit rate is $10$ minutes per pool. To find the number of minutes that the pump takes to empty $5$ pools, we multiply the unit rate by $5$ pools and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10\\times 5 & =50.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the pump will take $50$ minutes to empty $5$ pools.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-17330\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"17330\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"4746\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-17330\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Problem Solving Using the Ratio of a Fraction and an Integer</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"17330\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n       